<title>JAPAN: HORSE RACING-DRAW FOR JAPAN CUP.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-DRAW FOR JAPAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for Sunday's Japan Cup, to be run over 2,400 metres on turf at Tokyo Racecourse at 3.20 p.m. (0620 GMT) on Sunday (Japanese unless stated):</p>
<p>1. Strategic Choice (Britain) - R. Quinn</p>
<p>2. Go Go Z  - Y. Muamoto</p>
<p>3. Taiki Fortune - Y. Shibata</p>
<p>4. Fabulous la Fouine - M. Matsunaga</p>
<p>5. Saintly (Australia) - D. Beadman</p>
<p>6. Bubble Gum Fellow - Y. Okabe</p>
<p>7. Pentire (Britain) - M Hills</p>
<p>8. Sakura Keizan O - N. Yokoyama</p>
<p>9. Helissio (France) - O Peslier</p>
<p>10. Awad (U.S.) - C McCarron</p>
<p>11. Flag Down (U.S.) - J. Santos</p>
<p>12. Dance Partner - H. Shii</p>
<p>13. Kanetsu Cross - H. Matoba</p>
<p>14. Singspiel (Britain) - L Dettori</p>
<p>15. Yu Sensho - H Kawachi</p>
<p>16. Hishi Natalie - K Tsunoda</p>
